sec 12.6: the root handed its zikaron/1 seat to k2 by a succession nobody anchored; the stolen root key then closes the ledger at seq 1 and anchors first. No record earlier than its cut shows its handing off, so it is a candidate and wins the cut: the honest handover, closing succession and genesis are MALFORMED or EXCLUDED here, and the law reaches the theft only where the anchor set records the handing off.
